WEBVTT

1
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:23.946
The pit is already dug. We lay them here.

2
00:00:24.584 --> 00:00:28.933
Gently, now. Cross the arms. Let them look
up the slope.

3
00:00:39.584 --> 00:00:43.124
So young. The wind is cold up here.

4
00:00:43.751 --> 00:00:47.369
Stay with me a while. Then we fill it in,
together.

